protocol_sketch:
Streaming frames are newline-delimited JSON. New 'probe' frame example: {
  "frame_type": "probe",
  "probe_id": "p-1234",
  "intent": "search_results",
  "snippet": "Top result: Redwood inference blog summary...",
  "confidence": 0.34
}
Later authoritative tool frame: {
  "frame_type": "tool_result",
  "probe_id": "p-1234",
  "result": { ... }
}
Clients receive onProbe(probe) and may show a transient UI card. When onResolve(result) arrives for the same probe_id, the SDK triggers a reconciliation step and exposes a replace/patch function to the host application.
